<title>USA: Level One buys Silicon Design, sees charge.</title>
<headline>Level One buys Silicon Design, sees charge.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Level One Communications Inc said Thursday it had acquired Silicon Design Experts Inc, a privately-held engineering consulting group based in Morganville, N.J.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Level One said it will post a fourth quarter charge of $0.18 a share to reflect the purchase of in-process research and development related to the acquisition.  </p>
<p>Level One said the acquisition will give it access to high-speed computer networking technology that could be used for communications and multimedia applications.</p>
